# Apps Wavium turns on: on a fresh install (deploy/wavium/hooks/post-installation)
# and on every update (deploy/atrium-entrypoint.sh). One per line, "#" is a
# comment.
#
# It is a file and not two copies of a shell loop because the hooks only ever run
# on a fresh install: without the update path, an app added by a new version
# (Messages in v4) would ship its code to existing installs and stay switched
# off there.
mail
calendar
contacts
tasks
notes
daily_todo
messages
activity
dashboard
